   "Excess liquidity is currently falling and has turned negative due to rising global inflation, which historically signals poor forward returns for stocks over 1-6 month horizons.",
   "The market faces a significant supply glut, highlighted by the record-sized SpaceX IPO, which will likely pressure prices more than the illusory demand from MMFs.",
